        "body": "Whether you're a solo CEPA or leading a team of advisors, ELLA gives you the infrastructure to deliver consistent, high-quality exit planning engagements — without the manual overhead.\n\nStart with your first three clients free. No credit card required.",
        "closingLine": "Your practice deserves better tools.",
        "microcopy": "Your first 3 clients are on us.",
